    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "JB Kelly presents No. 18 Belltree Walk, a spacious three-bedroom corner property situated within the popular Belltree development in Clongriffin. The house benefits from a particularly sought after double-fronted design, generous parking to the side and a private landscaped rear garden. Its corner position also brings additional natural light into the accommodation, most noticeably in the living room with its dual-aspect windows.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation has a modern configuration with a spacious entrance hall with guest WC. To one side is a bright living room with windows on two elevations, while the kitchen/dining room provides a generous everyday living and dining space with a separate utility room off. Upstairs there are three bedrooms, including a main bedroom with en-suite shower room, a second bedroom with its own walk-in wardrobe, together with a separate family bathroom. A particularly useful feature is the very large attic space overhead, providing excellent storage and potential for future conversion, subject to the necessary building regulations and consents. Outside, the property has a cobble-locked driveway with space for two cars and there is a private rear garden off the kitchen dining room, providing a perfect space for children to play and outdoor entertainment. This house style is among the more sought-after layouts in the development, combining good room proportions with useful storage and a strong sense of space throughout.\r\n\r\nBelltree is well positioned for access to the wide range of amenities available throughout Clongriffin and the surrounding area. Clongriffin DART Station and regular bus services are within walking distance, providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre, while local shops and services are close at hand. Donaghmede Shopping Centre and Clarehall Shopping Centre are also easily accessible. One of the area's major amenities is Father Collins Park, with extensive landscaped grounds, walking and running routes, playgrounds and sports facilities. A variety of additional sporting and leisure facilities are available locally, making the area particularly convenient for families and commuters alike.\r\n\r\nCall JB Kelly 01-8393400 to arrange an appointment to view."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground floor\r\n\r\nEntrance hall\r\n2.75 x 2.20m\r\nLaminate flooring\r\n\r\nGuest WC\r\n2.25 x 1.55m\r\nLaminate floors, WC & WHB\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n3.75 x 5.60m\r\nLaminate floors, dual aspect windows, electric fireplace with hardwood surround\r\n\r\nKitchen Dining Room\r\n4.10 x 5.20m\r\nTiled floors and splashback, fully fitted modern kitchen with solid stone worktops.\r\nGas hob with extractor over, double oven, fridge freezer.\r\nGenerous dining space, glazed french-doors to landscaped rear garden.\r\n\r\nUtility Room/Larder\r\n1.25 x 1.30m\r\nTiled floors, washing machine and dryer, range of storage shelves\r\n\r\nFirst floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n3.40 x 3.80m\r\nSpacious master bedroom with fitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nEn-suite\r\n1.90 x 1.90m\r\nTiled floors and walls, WC, WHB and cubicle shower\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.40 x 2.15m\r\nBuilt-in wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n2.80 x 4.00\r\nDual aspect windows\r\n\r\nWalk-in Wardrobe\r\n2.05 x 1.45m\r\nSpacious walk-in closet space with fitted presses and storage\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\r\n2.45 x 1.70m\r\nTiled walls and floors, WC & WHB, bath, heated chrome towel rail"
      },
      {
