        "Content": "- Presented in turn-key condition\r\n- Corner position with wrap around plot\r\n- Off street parking for 2 cars via cobble-locked driveway\r\n- Gated side entrance\r\n- Sought after double-fronted design type\r\n- Gas fired central heating\r\n- Double glazed windows throughout\r\n- Very spacious attic space, partially floored with high head clearance - suitable for conversion\r\n- Bus, DART, shops, schools, sports facilities and local park all within easy walking distance"
